  "id": "functional-analysis",
  "term": "functional analysis",
  "definition": "Functional analysis here refers to analysing information that is treated as a continuous function, such as patterns unfolding over time, space, or frequency. In this context, it is used to model and interpret functional time-series data while examining how hidden states and their changing occupancy relate to characteristics within those states.",
